msgstr "Ihingiye kuri NUT"

#: upses.php
msgid "The Name you would like to give this UPS.  For APCUPSD and NUT Devices, a corresponding Cacti Device will be created automatically for the UPS using this name.  For SNMP based UPS's, you must create the Cacti Device first."
msgstr "Izina wifuza guha iyi UPS. Ku bikoresho bya APCUPSD na NUT, Igikoresho cya Cacti kijyanye kizaremwa mu buryo bwikora kuri iyi UPS hakoreshejwe iri zina. Kuri za UPS zishingiye kuri SNMP, ugomba kubanza kurema Igikoresho cya Cacti."

#: upses.php
msgid "New UPS"
msgstr "UPS Nshya"

#: upses.php
msgid "UPS Description"
msgstr "Ibisobanuro bya UPS"

#: upses.php
msgid "A more detailed Description of this UPS if required."
msgstr "Ibisobanuro birambuye by'iyi UPS niba bikenewe."

#: upses.php
msgid "UPS Type"
msgstr "Ubwoko bwa UPS"

#: upses.php
msgid "The Type of UPS you are monitoring."
msgstr "Ubwoko bwa UPS uri gukurikirana."

#: upses.php
msgid "Poller ID"
msgstr "ID ya Poller"

#: upses.php
msgid "The Poller that this UPS exists in is monitored by"
msgstr "Poller iyi UPS iherereyemo kandi ikurikiranwa na yo"

#: upses.php
msgid "Site Name"
msgstr "Izina ry'Ahantu"

#: upses.php
msgid "The Site that this UPS exists in."
msgstr "Ahantu iyi UPS iherereye."

#: upses.php
msgid "None"
msgstr "Nta na kimwe"

#: upses.php
msgid "Location"
msgstr "Aho iherereye"

#: upses.php
msgid "The physical location of the Device.  This free form text can be a room, rack location, etc."
msgstr "Aho igikoresho giherereye mu buryo bugaragara. Iyi nyandiko yigenga ishobora kuba icyumba, aho akabati kari, n'ibindi."

#: upses.php
msgid "Cacti Device"
msgstr "Igikoresho cya Cacti"

#: upses.php
msgid "For SNMP Based UPS', select the Cacti Device to use for SNMP credentials.  Otherwise, select None, and the UPS plugin will create the Device for you automatically."
msgstr "Kuri za UPS zishingiye kuri SNMP, hitamo Igikoresho cya Cacti kizakoreshwa ku byemezo bya SNMP. Bitabaye ibyo, hitamo Nta na kimwe, kandi umugereka wa UPS uzakuremera Igikoresho mu buryo bwikora."

#: upses.php
msgid "Autocreate on First Poll"
msgstr "Kurema mu buryo bwikora ku ikusanya rya mbere"

#: upses.php
msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "Bikoreshwa"

#: upses.php
msgid "Check to immediately start polling for data."
msgstr "Hitamo kugira ngo uhite utangira gukusanya amakuru."

#: upses.php
msgid "APC UPSD Information"
msgstr "Amakuru ya APC UPSD"

#: upses.php
msgid "The hostname of the host running apcupsd or the NUT server (upsd)."
msgstr "Izina rya seriveri ikoresha apcupsd cyangwa seriveri ya NUT (upsd)."

#: upses.php
msgid "TCP Port"
msgstr "Umuyoboro wa TCP"

#: upses.php
msgid "Enter the TCP Port for this UPS.  apcupsd defaults to 3551 and NUT defaults to 3493."
msgstr "Injiza umuyoboro wa TCP w'iyi UPS. Ku bisanzwe apcupsd ikoresha 3551 naho NUT igakoresha 3493."

#: upses.php
msgid "Timeout (seconds)"
msgstr "Igihe ntarengwa (amasegonda)"

#: upses.php
msgid "How long the poller waits for apcupsd or the NUT server before giving up on this UPS, from 1 to 120 seconds.  SNMP based UPS's use the SNMP timeout instead."
msgstr "Igihe poller itegereza apcupsd cyangwa seriveri ya NUT mbere yo guhagarika iyi UPS, kuva ku isegonda 1 kugeza ku 120. Za UPS zishingiye kuri SNMP zikoresha igihe ntarengwa cya SNMP mu cyimbo cy'ibi."

#: upses.php
msgid "NUT Options"
msgstr "Amahitamo ya NUT"

#: upses.php
msgid "NUT UPS Name"
msgstr "Izina rya UPS ya NUT"

#: upses.php
msgid "The name of the UPS on the NUT server, as listed by \"upsc -l\" (the part before the @ in ups@host).  One NUT server can serve several UPSes."
msgstr "Izina rya UPS kuri seriveri ya NUT, nk'uko rigaragazwa na \"upsc -l\" (igice kibanziriza @ muri ups@host). Seriveri imwe ya NUT ishobora gufasha za UPS nyinshi."

#: upses.php
msgid "NUT Username"
msgstr "Izina ry'ukoresha wa NUT"

#: upses.php
msgid "Optional.  The upsd.users account to authenticate with.  Leave blank for anonymous read-only access, which is how NUT servers are usually monitored."
msgstr "Si itegeko. Konti ya upsd.users yo kwemeza umwirondoro. Hasige harimo ubusa ku burenganzira bwo gusoma gusa butagaragaza uwabukoze, ari bwo buryo busanzwe bwo gukurikirana seriveri za NUT."

#: upses.php
msgid "NUT Password"
msgstr "Ijambobanga rya NUT"

#: upses.php
msgid "The password for the NUT Username."
msgstr "Ijambobanga ry'Izina ry'ukoresha wa NUT."

#: upses.php
msgid "Use TLS (STARTTLS)"
msgstr "Koresha TLS (STARTTLS)"

#: upses.php
msgid "Encrypt the connection with STARTTLS before any credentials are sent.  The NUT server certificate and host name are verified, so the certificate must be trusted by the Cacti poller, or you can point to its CA / certificate file below."
msgstr "Shyira mu ibanga ihuza ukoresheje STARTTLS mbere y'uko ibyemezo byoherezwa. Icyemezo cya seriveri ya NUT n'izina rya seriveri biragenzurwa, ku bw'ibyo icyemezo kigomba kuba cyizewe na poller ya Cacti, cyangwa ushobora kwerekeza ku idosiye yayo ya CA / icyemezo hasi aha."

#: upses.php
msgid "CA / Certificate File"
msgstr "Idosiye ya CA / Icyemezo"

#: upses.php
msgid "Optional.  The full path on the Cacti poller to a PEM file holding the CA certificate (or the self-signed server certificate) to verify the NUT server against, for example /etc/nut/upsd.pem.  The host name above must match the certificate."
msgstr "Si itegeko. Inzira yuzuye kuri poller ya Cacti igana ku idosiye ya PEM irimo icyemezo cya CA (cyangwa icyemezo cya seriveri cyisinyiye) cyo kugenzura seriveri ya NUT, urugero /etc/nut/upsd.pem. Izina rya seriveri hejuru rigomba guhura n'icyemezo."

#: upses.php
msgid "Allow Self-Signed Certificate"
msgstr "Emerera Icyemezo Cyisinyiye"

#: upses.php
msgid "Accept any certificate without checking it.  The connection is still encrypted, but the NUT server is not authenticated, so a man-in-the-middle could read the NUT credentials.  Prefer the CA / Certificate File above."
msgstr "Emera icyemezo icyo ari cyo cyose utagisuzumye. Ihuza rikomeza gushyirwa mu ibanga, ariko seriveri ya NUT ntiyemezwa, bityo uwicaye hagati yashobora gusoma ibyemezo bya NUT. Hitamo Idosiye ya CA / Icyemezo hejuru."

#: upses.php
msgid "SNMP Options"
msgstr "Amahitamo ya SNMP"

#: upses.php
msgid "The hostname where the snmp agent is located."
msgstr "Izina rya seriveri aho umukozi wa snmp aherereye."

#: upses.php
msgid "The Poller ID cannot be changed while the UPS is linked to a Cacti Device.  Change the poller on the device instead."
msgstr "ID ya Poller ntishobora guhindurwa igihe UPS ihujwe n'Igikoresho cya Cacti. Ahubwo hindura poller ku gikoresho."

#: upses.php
msgid "Template UPS was not found! Unable to duplicate."
msgstr "Inyandikorugero ya UPS ntiyabonetse! Ntibishoboka gukora kopi."

#: upses.php
msgid "None of the selected UPSes has a Cacti Device yet, so Graph Automation was not run.  A device is created on the first successful poll."
msgstr "Nta na imwe muri za UPS zahiswemo iragira Igikoresho cya Cacti, ku bw'ibyo Ikorwa ry'Ibishushanyo mu buryo bwikora ntiryatangiye. Igikoresho kiremwa ku ikusanya rya mbere rigenze neza."

#: upses.php
#, php-format
msgid "Graph Automation was run for %d UPS(es).  %d UPS(es) have no Cacti Device yet and were skipped."
msgstr "Ikorwa ry'Ibishushanyo mu buryo bwikora ryakozwe kuri UPS %d. UPS %d ntiziragira Igikoresho cya Cacti kandi zasimbwe."

