msgid "Click 'Continue' to run Graph Automation for the following UPS.  Graphs, data sources and tree items are created from the device's templates and the matching automation rules; graphs that already exist are left as they are.  Only a UPS that already has a Cacti Device is affected."
msgid_plural "Click 'Continue' to run Graph Automation for the following UPSes.  Graphs, data sources and tree items are created from each device's templates and the matching automation rules; graphs that already exist are left as they are.  Only a UPS that already has a Cacti Device is affected."
msgstr[0] "Kanda 'Komeza' kugira ngo ukoreshe Ikorwa ryikora ry'imbonerahamwe kuri UPS ikurikira.  Imbonerahamwe, amasoko y'amakuru n'ibigize igiti bikorwa hifashishijwe inyandikorugero z'igikoresho n'amategeko y'imikorere yikora bihuye; imbonerahamwe zisanzwe zihari zisigara uko ziri.  UPS isanzwe ifite Igikoresho cya Cacti ni yo yonyine igirwaho ingaruka."
msgstr[1] "Kanda 'Komeza' kugira ngo ukoreshe Ikorwa ryikora ry'imbonerahamwe kuri za UPS zikurikira.  Imbonerahamwe, amasoko y'amakuru n'ibigize igiti bikorwa hifashishijwe inyandikorugero za buri gikoresho n'amategeko y'imikorere yikora bihuye; imbonerahamwe zisanzwe zihari zisigara uko ziri.  UPS isanzwe ifite Igikoresho cya Cacti ni yo yonyine igirwaho ingaruka."

